~ start
do SignalManager.cutscene_started.emit()
Amelia: Yay, the lights are back on!
Theodore: And now the shadows have disa-beared. Good job.
Amelia: Ok, what next? This is not normal. Someone, or [shake rate=20 level=10]something[/shake], tore the wires up.
Theodore: We'll get to the bottom of this. Where do you think the attic key is?
Amelia: Last time Dad went up there, it was to move stuff to the basement . . . .
Theodore: He threw out his back doing that. He wasn't very lim-bear.
Amelia: . . . I think the door is outside.
do SignalManager.cutscene_ended.emit()
do SignalManager.dialogue_ended.emit()
=> END
